# Client-supplied source media for the padel build.
#
# The top-level Assets/ files (the academy's own photographs and the brand
# sheet) ARE versioned — they are the input to tools/ingest_media.py in
# travelproductions-padel, and the build cannot be reproduced without them.

# Assets/Marbella Photos/ is held back (~74 MB). The filenames of several of
# these — 2220_puerto-banus-2_introfull.jpg, 2236_bulevar-san-pedro-alcantara,
# 2246_aloha-golf, and siblings — match the naming convention of the Marbella
# tourism office's professional-area galleries. This project already carries a
# drafted, UNSENT authorisation request for exactly that material
# (travelproductions-padel/architecture/PERMISSION-REQUEST.md), whose own terms
# state that the general licence is personal/private use only and that nothing
# will be used until the council replies.
#
# So these stay out of the repo and out of the build until provenance is
# confirmed. If they turn out to be the academy's own photography, delete this
# rule — several are high-resolution landscape frames that would suit the wide
# background bands better than the portrait phone shots currently in those slots.
Assets/Marbella Photos/

# Playwright screenshots of the source site.
recreation/self-check/*.png
